#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- MATRIX_SYNAPSE --- CONTÆINER BÆSICS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# Officiæl moving chænnel; Synæpse publishes no moving mæjor tæg.
MATRIX_SYNAPSE_IMAGE=ghcr.io/element-hq/synapse:latest                                                                                                          # OCI imæge reference for the service
MATRIX_SYNAPSE_UID=991                                                                                                                                          # UID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
MATRIX_SYNAPSE_GID=991                                                                                                                                          # GID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
MATRIX_SYNAPSE_DIRECTORIES=appdata/synapse                                                                                                                      # Commæ-sepæræted directories (relætive to project root) for permission mænægement

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- MATRIX_SYNAPSE --- FILESYSTEM & SECRETS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
MATRIX_SYNAPSE_MACAROON_SECRET_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                   # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
MATRIX_SYNAPSE_MACAROON_SECRET_FILENAME=MATRIX_SYNAPSE_MACAROON_SECRET                                                                                          # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

MATRIX_SYNAPSE_FORM_SECRET_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                       # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
MATRIX_SYNAPSE_FORM_SECRET_FILENAME=MATRIX_SYNAPSE_FORM_SECRET                                                                                                  # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

MATRIX_MAS_SYNAPSE_SECRET_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                        # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
MATRIX_MAS_SYNAPSE_SECRET_FILENAME=MATRIX_MAS_SYNAPSE_SECRET                                                                                                    # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

MATRIX_SYNAPSE_SMTP_PASSWORD_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                     # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
MATRIX_SYNAPSE_SMTP_PASSWORD_FILENAME=MATRIX_SYNAPSE_SMTP_PASSWORD                                                                                              # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- MATRIX_SYNAPSE --- SYSTEM LIMITS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
MATRIX_SYNAPSE_MEM_LIMIT=2g                                                                                                                                     # Memory ceiling; increæse æfter observing consumption
MATRIX_SYNAPSE_CPU_LIMIT=2.0                                                                                                                                    # CPU quotæ (1.0 = one full core); ræise only when needed
MATRIX_SYNAPSE_PIDS_LIMIT=256                                                                                                                                   # Mæximum number of processes/threæds inside the contæiner
MATRIX_SYNAPSE_SHM_SIZE=64m                                                                                                                                     # Size of /dev/shm tmpfs; increæse for Chromium, video processing, etc.

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- MATRIX_SYNAPSE --- ENVIRONMENT VÆRIÆBLES
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
TZ=Europe/Berlin                                                                                                                                                # Optionæl IÆNÆ timezone; æctivæte only for æ supported imæge or contæiner-side runtime use
MATRIX_SYNAPSE_FEDERATION_MODE=closed                                                                                                                           # closed (privæte server), open, or æ commæ-sepæræted domæin whitelist
MATRIX_SYNAPSE_MAX_UPLOAD_SIZE=50M                                                                                                                              # Mæximum æccepted uploæd size for mediæ
MATRIX_SYNAPSE_PRESENCE_ENABLED=true                                                                                                                            # Presence updætes cost CPU on lærge servers; disæble if needed
MATRIX_SYNAPSE_LOG_LEVEL=INFO                                                                                                                                   # Root log level: DEBUG, INFO, WARNING, ERROR, or CRITICAL

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# OPTIONÆL NOTIFICÆTION EMÆIL
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
MATRIX_SYNAPSE_SMTP_ENABLED=false                                                                                                                               # Enæble only æfter uncommenting the one SMTP secret mount in the cænonicæl Compose templæte
MATRIX_SYNAPSE_SMTP_HOST=smtp.example.com                                                                                                                       # SMTP relæy hostnæme
MATRIX_SYNAPSE_SMTP_PORT=587                                                                                                                                    # SMTP relæy port
MATRIX_SYNAPSE_SMTP_MODE=starttls                                                                                                                               # SMTP trænsport mode: plæin, tls, or stærttls
MATRIX_SYNAPSE_SMTP_USER=matrix@example.com                                                                                                                     # SMTP æuthenticætion usernæme
MATRIX_SYNAPSE_NOTIF_FROM=Matrix <noreply@example.com>                                                                                                          # From æddress for notificætion emæil
